export anchor GothicCathedralStyle:
    number: 278
    screen: CloudFiles
    name: Gothic cathedral
    idea: A dark stone nave where every panel rises to a pointed arch, files are set like stones between mortar joints, and rose window colours mark file types and statuses.
    base: dark
    palette:
        stone: #131217, the page with faint coursing lines, and fields
        nave: #1c1a21, arched panels and the style sheet
        vault: #24212b, the current nav, the pressed switch and gem tiles
        joint: #36313f, mortar lines and borders
        ink: #ece6da, text
        muted: #b4acbd, meta and labels
        gold: #dcab48, arch trim, headings, the primary button with dark text #1b1305, folders, Starred and focus
        ruby: #ef6f80, PDF and video gems
        sapphire: #88a6ff, image and document gems, Shared and storage lancets
        emerald: #5fcf98, the spreadsheet gem and Uploading
        amethyst: #c39af2, the archive gem, the selected row and Selected
    type:
        One carved serif, Iowan Old Style, Charter, Cambria, Georgia. The
        folder title is 42px semibold capitals tracked 0.18em, panel
        labels 13px gold capitals tracked 0.32em, file names 16px
        semibold, body 15px at 1.55. Statuses are 13px italic.
    layout:
        A centred portal header with Brightwork Drive in gold, the title
        Website redesign and a breadcrumb with cross separators. Below,
        three bays side by side, each a dark panel whose top rises in a
        pointed arch 76px tall with a gold inner arch line. The left bay,
        Drive, lists the five links split by joints, the current one with
        a gold edge, then 64.2 GB of 100 GB used over ten small lancet
        windows with six and a bit filled sapphire. The middle bay, The
        files, holds search, Upload, New folder and a List or Grid switch
        with a gold underline on List, then eight rows. Each row has a
        gabled gem tile in its type colour, the name over kind, the size,
        and date and person with statuses below. The selected row has an
        amethyst wash and outline. Uploading shows an emerald bar. The
        right bay, Details, shows the preview inside a rose window of eight
        coloured petals, the name, Starred, facts split by joints and full
        width Share, Download and Get link. Below 1120px Details moves
        under the others. Below 760px the bays stack.
    spacing: An 8px unit. 24px between bays, 20px bay padding, 10px rows.
    density: Medium. Three bays with plain rows.
    corners: Square, except every bay rises to a pointed arch and gems have a gabled top.
    borders: 1px mortar joints around bays and between rows, a gold inner line inside each arch.
    shadows: None. Depth comes from the arches and coloured glass.
    icons:
        1.5px line icons inside gabled gems coloured by file type. Status
        is an italic word with a star for Starred, two heads for Shared, an
        up arrow for Uploading and a checked box for Selected.
    focus: A 2px gold outline offset 3px with a soft gold halo.
    tone: Quiet and ceremonial, such as The files, Drive and Details.
